sequenceDiagram
  participant A as Browser A
  participant S as Socket.IO server
  participant B as Browser B
  A->>S: room:join(roomId, name)
  S-->>A: room:joined and room:users
  S-->>B: room:users
  A->>S: board:stroke(stroke)
  S-->>B: board:stroke(stroke)
  Note over S: MVP relays strokes; it does not persist board history.
